# synstudio effect
name    glow
label   Glow
group   Light
about   The whole picture blurred and screened back over itself
param   amount  0.5  0  1   Amount
param   radius  16   1  80  Radius
filter  [$in]split[g0][g1];[g1]gblur=sigma=$radius[g2];
filter  [g0][g2]blend=all_mode=screen:all_opacity=$amount[$out]
